---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'May 21, 2026';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Konfido Education" description="Privacy Policy for Konfido Education & Training. Learn how we collect, use, store, and protect student enquiry information.">
  <Navbar />

  <main class="legal-page">
    <section class="legal-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="section-tag">Legal</span>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container legal-content">
        <p>
          Konfido Education & Training PVT ("Konfido", "we", "us", or "our") respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, share, and protect information when you visit our website, submit an enquiry, contact our counsellors, or use our admission guidance services.
        </p>

        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We may collect information that you provide directly to us, including your name, phone number, email address, stream or course interest, preferred university, enquiry details, and any other information you choose to share through our forms, calls, messages, or emails.</p>
        <p>We may also collect limited technical information such as your IP address, browser type, device information, pages visited, referral source, and approximate location for website security, analytics, and service improvement.</p>

        <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to your admission, counselling, course, or university enquiries.</li>
          <li>To contact you by phone, SMS, email, WhatsApp, or other communication channels about our services.</li>
          <li>To help match you with relevant universities, courses, entrance guidance, or scholarship opportunities.</li>
          <li>To improve our website, counselling process, student support, and marketing communications.</li>
          <li>To detect misuse, prevent fraud, maintain security, and comply with applicable legal obligations.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Consent to Communication</h2>
        <p>By submitting an enquiry or contacting us, you authorize Konfido and its representatives to communicate with you about education counselling and admission-related services, including through phone, SMS, email, and messaging platforms. This consent applies even if your number is registered under a do-not-call or similar preference registry, to the extent permitted by applicable law.</p>

        <h2>Sharing of Information</h2>
        <p>We may share your information with partner universities, admission teams, service providers, technology vendors, email or communication providers, analytics providers, and legal or regulatory authorities where required. We do not sell your personal information for unrelated third-party marketing.</p>

        <h2>Storage and Security</h2>
        <p>Your information may be stored electronically or physically in India or with trusted service providers. We use reasonable administrative, technical, and organizational safeguards to protect your information. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

        <h2>Cookies and Analytics</h2>
        <p>Our website may use cookies, pixels, tags, or similar tools to understand website usage, improve performance, and measure marketing campaigns. You can disable cookies in your browser settings, but some website features may not work as intended.</p>

        <h2>Data Retention</h2>
        <p>We retain personal information for as long as necessary to provide services, respond to enquiries, maintain business records, resolve disputes, comply with legal obligations, and improve our services.</p>

        <h2>Your Choices</h2>
        <p>You may request access, correction, deletion, or withdrawal of consent for your personal information by contacting us. We may retain certain information where required for legal, regulatory, fraud prevention, or legitimate business purposes.</p>

        <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>Our website may include links to third-party websites, universities, or services. Their privacy practices are governed by their own policies, and we are not responsible for their content or data practices.</p>

        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>For privacy questions or requests, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@konfido.co.in">info@konfido.co.in</a> or call <a href="tel:+919502644931">+91 95026 44931</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
.legal-page { padding-top: 76px; }
.legal-hero {
  background: linear-gradient(150deg, var(--navy) 0%, var(--navy-mid) 100%);
  color: var(--white);
  padding-block: 72px 56px;
}
.legal-hero h1 {
  font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.legal-hero p { color: rgba(255,255,255,.62); }
.legal-content {
  max-width: 860px;
  color: var(--text-mid);
}
.legal-content h2 {
  color: var(--navy);
  font-size: 1.35rem;
  margin-top: 36px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.legal-content p { margin-bottom: 16px; }
.legal-content ul {
  list-style: disc;
  padding-left: 22px;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}
.legal-content li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
.legal-content a {
  color: var(--crimson);
  font-weight: 600;
}
</style>
